      "speaker": "government spokesperson",
      "role": "government spokesperson",
      "date": "2026-10-10",
      "text": "maintain pressure on Russia through the toughest sanctions regime ever imposed by the UK.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": -1,
      "source_url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/10/putin-tells-trump-peace-talks-are-unlikely-cites-ukraine-drone-attacks"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_a89c55aa6248",
      "speaker": "United Kingdom delegate",
      "role": "Delegate to the UN",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "Directly targeting civilian infrastructure may constitute a war crime",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "threat",
      "stance": -2,
      "source_url": "https://press.un.org/en/2026/sc16472.doc.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_2b8d3d2a560a",
      "speaker": "Kirsty McNeill",
      "role": "Minister for International Development and Africa",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "Brexit has done more harm than good",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": 2,
      "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/minister-for-international-development-and-africa-speech-at-the-institute-of-international-and-european-affairs-dublin"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_49731c08e3bd",
      "speaker": "Kirsty McNeill",
      "role": "Minister for International Development and Africa",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "the first time the UK has sat around that table since Brexit",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 2,
      "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/minister-for-international-development-and-africa-speech-at-the-institute-of-international-and-european-affairs-dublin"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_5e2a3c23082e",
      "speaker": "Kirsty McNeill",
      "role": "Minister for International Development and Africa",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "We’ve also restarted formal development discussions with the European Commission, our teams in Brussels are working together more closely, and we’re looking forward to the second UK-EU Summit later this year",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 2,
      "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/minister-for-international-development-and-africa-speech-at-the-institute-of-international-and-european-affairs-dublin"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_4de409b96240",
      "speaker": "Kirsty McNeill",
      "role": "Minister for International Development and Africa",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "At a moment when some are stepping back from international cooperation, we are stepping forward",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": 1,
      "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/minister-for-international-development-and-africa-speech-at-the-institute-of-international-and-european-affairs-dublin"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_b11dd55016c0",
      "speaker": "Kirsty McNeill",
      "role": "Minister for International Development and Africa",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "The UK and Ireland share common interests as nearest neighbours and more importantly common values including belief in democracy, multilateralism, the rule of law and standing up for those most in need, reflecting strength of the bilateral relationship.",
      "is_quote": false,
      "signal": "reassurance",
      "stance": 2,
      "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/minister-for-international-development-and-africa-speech-at-the-institute-of-international-and-european-affairs-dublin"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_f85d69f68cc5",
      "speaker": "Kirsty McNeill",
      "role": "Minister for International Development and Africa",
      "date": "2026-10-09",
      "text": "adopting a modern approach to development grounded in investment, stronger systems and local leadership – and rooted in shared solidarity and mutual interest",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 0,
      "source_url": "https://www.gov.uk/government/speeches/minister-for-international-development-and-africa-speech-at-the-institute-of-international-and-european-affairs-dublin"
    }
